                    "expectedOutput": "Simulasi Pemotongan Morfologis Porter Stemmer:\n-------------------------------------------------------\nKata Asli          | Hasil Stemming Porter\n-------------------------------------------------------\ncaresses           | caress              \nponies             | poni                \ncats               | cat                 \nfeed               | feed                \nagreed             | agree               \nplastered          | plaster             \nsinging            | sing                \n-------------------------------------------------------\nKarakteristik Stemming: Beroperasi secara heuristik tanpa kamus kosakata baku.",
