                        "expectedOutput": "Komparasi Efisiensi Parameter: BERT-base vs ALBERT-base:\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\nParameter Embedding  : BERT = 23,040,000 | ALBERT = 3,938,304 (Hemat 82.9%)\nParameter Lapisan L  : BERT = 84,934,656 | ALBERT = 7,077,888 (Hemat 91.7%)\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\nTotal Parameter Inti : BERT = 107,974,656 (~108.0M)\nTotal Parameter Inti : ALBERT = 11,016,192 (~11.0M)\nFaktor Reduksi Ukuran: Model ALBERT 9.8x lipat lebih ramping!",
