                        "expectedOutput": "Mekanisme Distilasi Pengetahuan DistilBERT (Sanh et al. 2019):\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\nProbabilitas Lembut Teacher (T=3.0): [0.5872 0.2728 0.14  ]\nProbabilitas Lembut Student (T=3.0): [0.4751 0.3185 0.2065]\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\nDistillation Loss (T^2 * KL-Div)   : 0.2502\nEfek Suhu (T): Mengamplifikasi 'dark knowledge' pada probabilitas kelas non-target.",
