                "title": "12.5. 12.5 Peringkasan Teks Abstrak (Abstractive Text Summarization, CNN/DailyMail, XSum, Hallucination Mitigation)",
                "orderIndex": 5,
                "description": "Kajian mendalam dan implementasi mandiri untuk 12.5 Peringkasan Teks Abstrak (Abstractive Text Summarization, CNN/DailyMail, XSum, Hallucination Mitigation) dalam domain NLP modern.",
